WEBVTT

00:32:58.840 --> 00:33:01.216
The first destination
for your mental time machine

00:33:01.240 --> 00:33:02.786
is the future.

00:33:02.810 --> 00:33:04.816
That's where Scott started.

00:33:04.840 --> 00:33:07.666
Months before he set foot
in the rocket to leave Earth,

00:33:07.690 --> 00:33:11.406
Scott started imagining
how he wanted his trip to end.

00:33:11.430 --> 00:33:14.339
He didn't just focus on
what he wanted to accomplish.

00:33:14.363 --> 00:33:18.046
He imagined how he wanted to feel
when his mission was wrapping up.

00:33:18.070 --> 00:33:22.396
SK: My goal was to get to the end of this

00:33:22.420 --> 00:33:26.966
with the same enthusiasm
and ability and energy

00:33:26.990 --> 00:33:28.229
as I had in the beginning,

00:33:28.253 --> 00:33:31.056
and I always wanted to convince myself